### 48. GET rooms without login (Expect: 200 OK, 4 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 49. GET /api/auth/me as lee with Basic (Expect: 200 lee, ROLE_USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Basic bGVlOmxlZTEyMzQ1

### 50. Log in as lee to get JWT token (Expect: 200 accessToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lee",
  "password": "lee12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 51. Log in with wrong password (Expect: 401 wrong username or password)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lee",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 52. GET /api/auth/me with Bearer token (Expect: 200 lee)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 53. POST room with Bearer token (Expect: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Token Room",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 54. POST room with broken token (Expect: 401 token is invalid or expired)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer invalid.broken.token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken Token Room",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 55. GET rooms with broken token (Expect: 401 token is invalid or expired)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer invalid.broken.token

### 56. GET reservations without login (Expect: 401 login required)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina